                        {
                           "Duration": 17.6,
                           "TextFadeDuration": 17.400000000000002,
                           "FadeInTime": 0.2,
                           "FadeOutTime": 0.2,
                           "String": "Island in the Nile Delta, 8000 BCE\n\nEgypt is a land blessed with plentiful plants and wildlife, making it an excellent place to settle your wandering tribe of hunters and gatherers. Even though your people have primitive technology and rely on stone tools, they are skilled hunters.",
                           "ImageRect": {
                              "x": 0,
                              "y": 0,
                              "width": 3840,
                              "height": 2160
                           },
                           "TextRect": {
                              "x": 230,
